            "person_id": "yd9_rqt_a0v",
            "status": "contextual_provisional",
            "resolution_note": "清河、與盧諶同博藝/書名士、陷石氏履歷相合，魏024祖悦與范陽盧諶齊名的具體二人橋；悅/悦/恱原字各保。"
          },
          "source_id": "s-jinshu-044-ws1775345-luchen-cuiyue"
        },
        {
          "record": {
            "id": "nc-jin044-yue_style",
            "person_id": "yd9_rqt_a0v",
            "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-044-luchen-cuiyue",
            "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-044-luchen-cuiyue:p004",
            "surname": null,
            "ming": "悅",
            "quote": "悅字道儒，魏司空林曾孫，劉琨妻子之侄也。與諶俱為琨司空從事中郎，後為末波佐史。沒石氏，亦居大官。其綽、憲、暢並別有傳。"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "id": "c-jinshu-044-luchen-cuiyue:p004:m0000",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 1,
            "surface": "悅",
